{"surah":97,"ayahs":["إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">نَّآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نزَ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَٰ</span>هُ فِى لَيْلَةِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رِ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ مَا لَيْلَةُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رِ","لَيْلَةُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رِ خَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ مِّ</span>نْ أَلْفِ شَهْرٍ","تَنَزَّلُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَٰٓ</span>ئِكَةُ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رُّوحُ فِيهَا بِإِذْنِ رَبِّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_shafawi\">هِم مِّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن كُ</span>لِّ أَمْرٍ","سَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">لَٰ</span>مٌ هِىَ حَتَّىٰ مَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">طْ</span>لَعِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>رِ"]}